- the `init.py` entry point, command-line interfaces, scanner and audit logic, runtime request-guard components, host and provider abstractions, governance and approval features, report-generation code, packaging/build metadata, and release/distribution tooling;
- first-party documentation, diagrams, text, original designs, and other original repository assets.

