11.4 Ordinary AI-assisted coding, debugging, explanation, and documentation work is permitted for a Non-Commercial Purpose where the AI provider and selected settings do not use submitted Covered Materials for prohibited training, fine-tuning, distillation, or model improvement. Do not submit secrets, private source, personal information, or third-party materials without authorization.

